dsh-widescreen README · How it works：```css
html[data-dsh-widescreen="on"] [data-conversation-scroll],
html[data-dsh-widescreen="on"] [data-composer-seat] {
  --dsh-chat-content-width: 100%;
}

`--dsh-composer-card-max-width` derives from the same variable, so the composer follows automatically. Because the value is container-relative (`100%`), the original viewport/zoom-responsive reflow is untouched.
